        "comments": "The assembly ddSalAlba3.hap1.1 is based on 77x PacBio data and Arima2 Hi-C data generated by the Darwin Tree of Life Project\n(https://www.darwintreeoflife.org/). The assembly process included the following sequence of steps: initial PacBio assembly generation with Hifiasm in Hi-C integrated assembly mode, and Hi-C based scaffolding with YaHS. The mitochondrial and plastid genomes were assembled using OATK. Finally, each haplotype assembly was analysed and manually improved using TreeVal. Chromosome-scale scaffolds confirmed by the Hi-C data have been named in order of size. This assembly is tetraploid, however, in order to capture the genomic diversity of the assembly, the assembly files have been split into two to include on copy of each homeologue from each ancestral genome.",
